  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy Support to CUA&apos;s Social Services Provision</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support local CUA offices with the financial, legal and operational resources necessary to apply for, manage and deliver Resilience Centres and Supported Living Services on behalf of the Ukrainian Government. As part of the project CAFOD will support CUA to advocate for amendments to regulatory acts governing the provision of the services and to lobby for the reduction in bureaucracy, and funding for financial, legal and operational resources for managing the services.</narrative>
  </description>
